@baseUrl = http://localhost:3033

### Top gappers (último ranking persistido)
GET {{baseUrl}}/screener/gappers
Accept: application/json

### Top gainers — session + intraday
GET {{baseUrl}}/screener/gainers
Accept: application/json

### Top gainers — solo sesión (lista plana)
GET {{baseUrl}}/screener/gainers/session
Accept: application/json

### Symbols activos (dedupe global top 40)
GET {{baseUrl}}/screener/combined
Accept: application/json

### Active symbols — con score y rank
GET {{baseUrl}}/screener/active
Accept: application/json

### Highs — session vs current
GET {{baseUrl}}/screener/highs
Accept: application/json

### Status — última corrida screener
GET {{baseUrl}}/screener/status
Accept: application/json

### Forzar pipeline completo (mismo que cron de mercado)
POST {{baseUrl}}/screener/force-sync
Accept: application/json
